Package: hopwyn
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xdg-desktop-portal
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | xdg-desktop-portal-kde
Description: one mouse and keyboard for every computer in your home
 Move the cursor off the edge of one screen and it appears on the next;
 the computer you left goes inactive and the one you entered becomes
 active. Pair by clicking Add computer on one and Pair on both, with up to
 four computers arranged around the screen.
 .
 No account and no cloud: everything stays on the home network, encrypted
 with TLS 1.3 and pinned device keys. Needs a desktop with the
 InputCapture portal (GNOME 45+, KDE Plasma 6.1+). Developer preview.
